# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — this repo is PUBLIC. Nothing below may ever be committed.
#
# Format/ and "Files for claude code/" are excluded because three files in them
# carry live credentials:
#   Format/OSL-2026-tournament-app_24.html   Supabase anon JWT + ADMIN_DEFAULT
#   Format/pickleboss-35split 12.html        Supabase anon JWT + ADMIN_DEFAULT
#   Files for claude code/claude-code-brief.md   Supabase key in plaintext
#
# They are reference material, not build inputs (see CLAUDE.md), so excluding
# them costs the build nothing. Keep them on local disk / a private repo.
#
# Committing a secret and deleting it later does NOT remove it — it stays in
# git history and must be treated as compromised.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Format/
Files for claude code/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
service-role*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
